    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Formerly, The Mens Snooker & Social Club, this well known building is situated in a superb location close to Grattan Square, a short walk to all town amenities including, Dungarvan Shopping Centre, Dungarvan Quayside with restaurants and Bars and ten minutes walk from The Waterford Greenway. This substantial building extends over four floors and has the benefit of an expansive open yard and garden space to the rear. This opportunity is well presented with the benefit of full residential planning permission granted by Waterford City & County Council for \r\nsix apartment units, 4 No. one bedroom apartments, and 2 No. two bedroom apartments throughout. \r\nThis building has been cleared and prepared to commence works and at this great location presents a unique investment opportunity for any discerning developer.\r\n\r\nCONTACT DNG MORRISSEY PROPERTIES FOR MORE DETAILED DRAWINGS AND ALL INFORMATION.\r\n\r\nViewing Strictly by Appointment.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n___________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE.\r\n\r\nDNG Morrissey properties, for themselves and for the Vendors or Lessors of the property whose Agents they are, give notice that; 1. The particulars contained herein are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or tenants, and do not constitute any part of any offer or contract and are not in any way legally binding. 2. All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. 3. No person in the employment of DNG Morrissey Properties has the authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this development. 4. The particulars contained herein are confidential and are given on the strict understanding that all negotiations shall be conducted through DNG Morrissey Properties. 5. DNG Morrissey Properties disclaims all liability and responsibility for any direct and/or indirect loss or damage which may be suffered by any recipient through relying on any particular contained in or omitted from the aforementioned particulars.\r\n\r\n\r\n___________________________________________________________________________"
      },
